</div>
              </div>
            </div><div class="collapsible-content__copy">
          
          <div class="body rte"><p>A hydrating lip balm packed with antioxidants + natural emollients to nourish dry, chafed skin.</p></div>
          <div id="acc-template--22541868204277__collapsible_content_T3FFEz" class="acc js-acc" data-enable-section-accordion="" data-initial-accordion-state="closed">
            
              
              
                <div class="acc__inner">
              
                  <div class="acc__item">
                    <button type="button" class="acc__btn js-acc-btn">
                      <span class="acc__title">
                        Castor Seed Oil
                      </span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="acc__menu js-acc-menu" aria-expanded="false">
                      <p>A plant-based oil with fatty acids and unique water-binding properties to help keep lips moisturized.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
              
            
              
              
                  <div class="acc__item">
                    <button type="button" class="acc__btn js-acc-btn">
                      <span class="acc__title">
                        Beeswax
                      </span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="acc__menu js-acc-menu" aria-expanded="false">
                      <p>A naturally-derived emollient that leaves lips feeling cushiony and non-sticky.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
              
            
              
              
                  <div class="acc__item">
                    <button type="button" class="acc__btn js-acc-btn">
                      <span class="acc__title">
                        Lanolin
                      </span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="acc__menu js-acc-menu" aria-expanded="false">
                      <p>A conditioning oil that nourishes and moisturizes the lips, while providing a unique formula texture and barrier to help prevent dryness.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
              
                </div>
              
            
              
              
                <div class="acc__inner">
              
                  <div class="acc__item">
                    <button type="button" class="acc__btn js-acc-btn">
                      <span class="acc__title">
                        Phyto-Antioxidant Blend
                      </span>
                    </button>
                    <div class="acc__menu js-acc-menu" aria-expanded="false">
                      <p>An antioxidant blend of Vitamin E, Rice Bran and Rosemary Extracts to help combat free-radical damage and support and maintain the integrity of delicate lips.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
              
                </div>
              
            
          </div>
          
