<section class="container media-text media-text--collapsible js-collapsible-section media--full" id="section-template--22541868204277__media_text_section_BMrHFm" data-collapsible-section-index="2">
  <div id="media-text-acc-template--22541868204277__media_text_section_BMrHFm" class="media-text__acc acc js-acc" data-enable-section-accordion="true" data-initial-accordion-state="default" style="">
    
      <button type="button" class="media-text__acc-btn acc__btn js-acc-btn is-active"><span class="acc__title"><div class="headline media-text__headline ">HOW TO USE
</div></span></button>
    
    <div class="media-text__acc-menu acc__menu js-acc-menu media-text__acc-menu--auto-height is-open" data-hidden-styles-width="100%" data-hidden-styles-height="314" aria-expanded="true" style="display: block; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 0px; height: 314px;">
      <div class="media-text__wrapper media-text__wrapper--flipped">
        <div class="media-text__content media-text__content--stretch media-text__content--slim">
          
<h2 class="media-text__heading">
              Apply to lips wherever and whenever you need an extra dose of moisture.
            </h2><div class="media-text__description rte">
              <ol><li>Squeeze a small amount directly to dry, chapped lips or your fingertip.</li><li>Reapply throughout the day if you need extra hydration, or you know, you just miss us.</li><li>While you’re at it, apply Original to cuticles, elbows, or wherever else could use some moisture. Lips shouldn’t get to have all the fun!</li></ol>
            </div></div>
        
        <div class="media-text__media"><div class="media-text__image">
                

                

                


  
    

    <div class="ir ir--media-text-image hide-mobile">
<img class="" src="https://glossier-prod.imgix.net/files/glossier-iheartny-balm-highlight-02.png?auto=compress,format&amp;cs=srgb&amp;w={width}" alt="">

