          <p>—</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bag__totals bag__summary--row js-bag-summary-row hide" id="bagShippingSummary">
          <p data-fst-text="" data-fst-currency-code="USD">Shipping <span class="bag__shipping-summary-parenthesis js-bag-shipping-summary-parenthesis">(Free express shipping over Rs. 11,230)</span></p>
